  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 7 x plus 1\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function gives the total number of people on a company retreat with <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> managers. What is the total number of people on a company retreat with <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math> managers?</p>",
